+
+This example shows a minimal Spring Boot app. Production OTEL auto-instrumentation is achieved by running the Java agent:
+
+1) Build:
+   mvn -q -DskipTests package
+
+2) Run with OpenTelemetry Java agent (example using otel/opentelemetry-javaagent.jar):
+   java -javaagent:/opt/otel/opentelemetry-javaagent.jar \
+     -Dotel.exporter.otlp.endpoint=http://otel-collector:4317 \
+     -jar target/otel-springboot-0.1.0.jar
+
+Notes:
+- Provide correct OTLP/collector endpoint.
+- For Kubernetes deployments, mount the agent JAR into the container image or use an init container pattern.
